 · intro w hw
   rcases Finset.mem_insert.mp (buildTriple_support acc Z bank cin src q r p ha hs hz hb hw) with eq|hw
   · simp [eq]
   rcases Finset.mem_insert.mp (buildDual_support acc Z bank cin src q r ha hs hz hb hw) with eq|hw
